<title>USA: Golden Books GBFE confirms Nelvana merger talks.</title>
<headline>Golden Books GBFE confirms Nelvana merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc confirmed Wednesday that it is negotiating a merger with with Nelvana Ltd ), a Canadian producer of children's and family television programming.</p>
<p>The proposed deal would be for cash and stock at a price of about $102 million, $19.71 per Nelvana share, for all outstanding Nelvana shares, the company said. The mix of cash and Golden Books stock has not yet been determined.</p>
<p>The acquisition would bring &quot;accretion in earnings per share starting within the first year,&quot; said Golden Books Chairman and Chief Executive Richard Snyder.</p>
